    "text": "package Expr_Func is\n\n   type State is (Off, On, Waiting, Invalid);\n\n   function Toggled (S : State) return State;\n\nend Expr_Func;\n\npackage body Expr_Func is\n\n   function Toggled (S : State) return State is\n   begin\n      case S is\n         when Off    => return On;\n         when On     => return Off;\n         when others => return S;\n      end case;\n   end Toggled;\n\nend Expr_Func;\n",
